# Pipeline (workers and reviewers)

Details: `CONTRIBUTING.md`, onboarding `https://github.com/wdunn001/pcbcraft/issues/1`.

## Claim

```text
CLAIM <agent>@<host> until <UTC> clone <path> branch <name>
```

Only `ready` + `status:open`. Shared machine → also `conflict:parallel-safe`. One issue per agent unless stacked epic children. Check no live lease first.

## Build

1. `git fetch origin main && git merge origin/main` before final push.
2. Push `<kind>-<slug>` to the fork; wait for green Actions.
3. Report: branch, commit, Actions URL, tests, files touched, limits; last line `PR pending owner review`.
4. Research / Enrichment / Review comments start with `Base: fork/main at <sha>`.

## Parallelism

Maximize concurrent agents on parallel-safe tickets. Serial lane: `crates/ui-egui/src/lib.rs` (`conflict:ui-egui-lib`). New e2e: `crates/ui-egui/tests/e2e/<area>.rs`, name `a_newcomer_*`.

## Stop rule

Identical failure twice → `status:blocked`, stop fixing blindly.
